WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:05.040
New video game adaptations. Prequels&nbsp;
to a popular show and one of the most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:10.480
famous book and film series of all time.&nbsp;
More Star Wars stuff. There’s lots of new&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:16.480
shows coming out this year! How will a Jedi Knight&nbsp;
return to our screens? Keep watching to find out.

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:22.720
Fans of J.R.R Tolkien's epic fantasy adventure&nbsp;
series and Peter Jackson's subsequent film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:28.000
adaptations are in for a treat. "The Lord&nbsp;
of the Rings" is returning to live-action&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.600
once again — this time as an&nbsp;
Amazon Prime series. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:36.640
this isn't a simple recreation of the path that's&nbsp;
already been well-tread by Jackson and crew.

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:41.040
While there isn't much detail about the&nbsp;
plot at all, as of the making of this video,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:45.600
we do know from Amazon's release of&nbsp;
a series companion map that it is set&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.760
thousands of years before the events of&nbsp;
"The Hobbit" or "The Lord of the Rings,"&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:54.560
during a time when a shadowy evil was attempting&nbsp;
to sow its seeds among the hills of Middle-Earth,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:57.840
much like Sauron’s conquest&nbsp;
in the popular trilogy.

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:02.720
The show will, of course, present a wholly new&nbsp;
cast of characters with an original story that is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:07.200
bound to set itself apart from the films that we&nbsp;
all know and love. "The Lord of the Rings" series&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:13.920
debuts in September and promises to be one of the&nbsp;
most expensive TV series ever made. According to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:21.200
The Hollywood Reporter, the first season alone has&nbsp;
a production price tag coming in at $465 million.

00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:28.960
Marvel is plodding along continuing their&nbsp;
lucrative vortex that is the MCU, constantly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:34.160
spitting out all sorts of projects. Disney+&nbsp;
is offering a smattering of new Marvel-centric&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:39.920
shows in 2022, including "She-Hulk." Tatiana&nbsp;
Maslany plays the role of Jennifer Walters,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:45.040
a lawyer for metahumans who ultimately becomes&nbsp;
She-Hulk. As part of Phase Four of the MCU,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:48.560
"She-Hulk" Season 1 will&nbsp;
come packed with 10 episodes.

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:53.120
Via Discussing Film, Kevin Feige shared that&nbsp;
"She-Hulk" opts to take a bit of a different&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:57.040
tone from the traditional Marvel fair as it&nbsp;
will lean heavier into the comedic side of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.040 --> 00:02:02.160
the Marvel world. "She-Hulk" fans will also see&nbsp;
Mark Ruffalo reprise his role as Bruce Banner,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:06.000
as well as Tim Roth returning as the&nbsp;
Abomination, per The Hollywood Reporter.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:10.880
For those who remember the earliest "Hulk" film&nbsp;
in the MCU that originally starred Edward Norton&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:16.160
in this role, Roth played Emil Blonsky, who&nbsp;
transformed into the sinister Abomination.

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:20.000
As is typical of Marvel productions,&nbsp;
there's likely to be many cameos&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:23.200
and interactions with other MCU&nbsp;
characters throughout the show,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:27.440
as the creators behind Marvel productions&nbsp;
are always throwing surprises at audiences.

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:32.880
"The Last of Us" is an ultra-popular&nbsp;
PlayStation game developed by Naughty Dog.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:37.840
The game has earned countless awards for not only&nbsp;
its game mechanics, but the depth of the writing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:43.520
and the journey of the game's lead characters.&nbsp;
If any video game was made to be adapted into an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:49.200
epic drama, it's "The Last of Us." HBO snapped&nbsp;
up the property due to its enduring popularity,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:54.560
and has cast Pedro Pascal and Bella Ramsey&nbsp;
in the lead roles of Joel Miller and Ellie.

00:02:54.560 --> 00:03:00.720
The story centers around an apocalyptic Cordyceps&nbsp;
fungal infection that slowly deteriorates its host&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:07.120
into a ravenous zombie-like monstrosity. Joel is a&nbsp;
survivor in the post-apocalyptic landscape who is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:12.640
tasked with delivering Ellie, a young girl, to an&nbsp;
underground organization known as the Fireflies.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:16.400
The scope of the game follows the&nbsp;
bond that Joel and Ellie develop as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:21.520
well as the revelations that occur along their&nbsp;
cross-country adventure. The HBO series is sure&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:21.520 --> 00:03:28.240
to offer up a raw portrayal of the game's themes&nbsp;
and overall plot in pristine live-action glory.

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:33.520
With a Metacritic user score&nbsp;
of 8.7 out of a possible 10,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:39.200
"How I Met Your Mother" is one of the most popular&nbsp;
modern sitcoms of all time. For comparison,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:44.880
"Friends" has a score of 8.5 on the same site.&nbsp;
Audiences apparently couldn't get enough of Ted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:49.440
Mosby telling his children the story of —&nbsp;
you guessed it — how he met their mother.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.440 --> 00:03:55.040
Quite possibly one of the longest stories a&nbsp;
father ever told his children about anything,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.040 --> 00:04:00.000
"How I Met Your Mother" went on to inspire&nbsp;
memes, parodies, and pop culture at large.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:04.480
In 2022, the show receives a spiritual&nbsp;
successor in the form of "How I Met Your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:10.480
Father." Hilary Duff stars as a young Sophie while&nbsp;
Kim Cattrall appears as her grown-up counterpart,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:14.800
once again telling the fabled story of&nbsp;
how she met their father to her children.

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:18.480
Like "How I Met Your Mother," the new series&nbsp;
follows a group of close friends as they come&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:23.680
into their own as young adults and figure out&nbsp;
what they want most out of life. If the show is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:28.720
anything like its predecessor, there'll be&nbsp;
plenty of hijinks, hilarity, and quotable lines&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:35.120
along the way. In the immortal words of Barney&nbsp;
Stinson, when the show hits Hulu on January 18:

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:41.821
"It's going to be legen – wait&nbsp;
for it – dary! Legendary!"

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:46.800
The ending of "Game of Thrones" was met with&nbsp;
weeping and wailing from certain fans. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:52.240
show's harshest critics cited a distinct lack&nbsp;
of character development and an apparent rush in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:58.080
narrative structure just to abruptly arrive at the&nbsp;
show's ham-fisted final curtain call. Some fans,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:03.520
however, wished it would simply have continued&nbsp;
far beyond the eighth season. Whatever side of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:03.520 --> 00:05:09.360
the fence you sit on, perhaps, you're willing to&nbsp;
give the brand another shot? The series undeniably&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:15.200
captivated the globe and became one of the most&nbsp;
watched high-fantasy epics in television history.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:20.960
Now HBO hopes those viewers are ready to return&nbsp;
for the prequel series "House of the Dragon."

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:27.040
The 2022 series is specifically based on George&nbsp;
R. R. Martin's novel "Fire &amp; Blood," which details&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:32.080
the history of Westeros two centuries before the&nbsp;
events of "Game of Thrones." House Targaryen's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:36.880
is central to the plot as the series covers&nbsp;
their downfall as one of the royal families&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:41.600
in Westeros. The cast is entirely new,&nbsp;
though some of the characters may have been&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:45.600
referenced during the "Game of Thrones"&nbsp;
narrative from a historical standpoint.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:49.520
Ultimately, the family known for its&nbsp;
ties and interactions with dragons is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:54.960
certain to entertain in a wildly dramatic and&nbsp;
bloody fashion as fans have come to expect.

00:05:55.840 --> 00:06:02.080
Oscar Isaac makes his grand entrance into the&nbsp;
Marvel Cinematic Universe with the debut of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:08.640
the hero Moon Knight in his own 2022 Disney+&nbsp;
series. Once again, Marvel is plunging deep&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.640 --> 00:06:12.800
into its pantheon of characters that might&nbsp;
be lesser known to the general populace.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:18.640
Marc Spector is the identity behind the hero who&nbsp;
suffers from dissociative identity disorder. As a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:24.400
former marine and CIA operative, he is well versed&nbsp;
in the art of combat and strategy. But the comic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:29.040
book realization of the character often depicts&nbsp;
him attempting to embrace the moral high ground.

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:32.080
DC and Marvel have finally begun breaking ground&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:36.960
into the realm of live action diversity.&nbsp;
Depicting a hero with a mental illness&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:41.440
is another drop in the bucket engaging&nbsp;
audiences who can relate with the struggle.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:47.040
The driving force behind his superhero identity&nbsp;
is the Egyptian moon god Khonshu. But ultimately,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:52.400
the character's abilities are all grounded in his&nbsp;
life experiences as a combatant in armed conflict.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:58.240
The show is sure to offer a fresh take on the&nbsp;
superhero genre with DID being a focal point,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:58.240 --> 00:07:03.440
and the series promises a lot of action&nbsp;
just by the very nature of the character.

00:07:04.240 --> 00:07:10.240
One of the biggest video game franchises of&nbsp;
all time, "Halo" is set to make its live action&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:15.600
debut on the Paramount+ streaming service in&nbsp;
2022. Fans will be able to sit back and watch&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:20.480
a cinematic retelling of the conflict between&nbsp;
humankind and the alien collective known as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:25.440
the Covenant. Pablo Schreiber from "The Wire"&nbsp;
will portray the man behind the iconic armor,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:30.560
Master Chief Petty Officer John-117. The&nbsp;
Spartan soldier leads the charge against the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:30.560 --> 00:07:35.040
alien threat and will likely be a driving&nbsp;
force in the upcoming live-action series.

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:40.400
Ardent "Halo" connoisseurs will likely take note&nbsp;
that the voice behind Cortana in the game series,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:45.600
Jen Taylor, is reprising her role for the&nbsp;
show, according to IGN. Live-action video&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:49.600
game adaptations have often proved to&nbsp;
be critical failures or, at the least,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:49.600 --> 00:07:55.040
divisive. Only time will tell whether "Halo"&nbsp;
proves to be as impactful as its source material.

00:07:55.920 --> 00:08:00.240
Hot off the heels of "The Witcher" Season&nbsp;
2, Netflix plans to satiate fans' desire&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:05.200
for more rather quickly compared to the&nbsp;
lengthy two-year gap between Season 1 and 2.

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:07.040
“It’s not too late.”

00:08:08.160 --> 00:08:12.000
This time, however, audiences will&nbsp;
be transported more than a thousand&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:16.560
years into the past with "The Witcher:&nbsp;
Blood Origin." With Geralt’s adventures&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.560 --> 00:08:21.920
on hold between seasons, "Blood Origin"&nbsp;
will portray the first Witcher ever created.

00:08:21.920 --> 00:08:26.480
In fact, speaking with Entertainment Weekly,&nbsp;
"Blood Origins" showrunner Lauren Hissrich&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:29.520
said that the prequel will flip&nbsp;
the script on the perception that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:29.520 --> 00:08:33.920
humans brought civilization to the elves.&nbsp;
She added that the events of the six-part&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:33.920 --> 00:08:38.240
series will shape some of the major arcs&nbsp;
for characters in Season 3 of "The Witcher."

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:42.880
The first teaser for "Blood Origin" debuted during&nbsp;
the credits of the "The Witcher" Season 2 finale,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:46.960
and it let audiences know that the&nbsp;
setting and action they've come to love&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:52.400
remains intact for the prequel. The miniseries is&nbsp;
set to release on the streaming service in 2022.

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:57.920
With a steady stream of new Marvel properties&nbsp;
hitting Disney's streaming service in 2022,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:57.920 --> 00:09:02.400
it's high time that Samuel L. Jackson's&nbsp;
Nick Fury made a return to the spotlight.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:07.360
In "Secret Invasion," Nick Fury will return&nbsp;
alongside Ben Mendelsohn's Talos and Cobie&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:07.360 --> 00:09:13.120
Smulders’ Maria Hill. The last time we saw Nick&nbsp;
Fury, he was working with the Skrulls off-world.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:13.120 --> 00:09:16.960
Talos had shapeshifted and played the&nbsp;
role of the former S.H.I.E.L.D. director&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:16.960 --> 00:09:20.960
to aid Peter Parker in his fight against&nbsp;
Mysterio in "Spider-man: Far From Home."

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:25.680
While the Skrulls are seemingly allies in the&nbsp;
MCU, the comic book storyline by the same name&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:25.680 --> 00:09:30.240
depicts the shapeshifting aliens capturing&nbsp;
and replacing many superheroes on Earth,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:30.240 --> 00:09:35.200
hence the title "Secret Invasion." Throughout&nbsp;
the series, it comes as a shock and surprise&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:40.320
finding out which characters are not truly&nbsp;
themselves. The six-part series is sure to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:40.320 --> 00:09:44.560
garner a lot of interest once it hits&nbsp;
Disney's streaming service in 2022.

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:50.320
It's time for the legendary Jedi Knight&nbsp;
to receive a bit of attention in the age&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:54.560
of streaming services. Ever since "Star&nbsp;
Wars" fans understood that there was a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:54.560 --> 00:09:59.120
lengthy gap in Obi-Wan Kenobi’s life missing&nbsp;
from the big screen, there were always going&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:04.080
to be opportunities to tell more stories&nbsp;
featuring Anakin Skywalker's former mentor.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:09.360
With Ewan McGregor back in the role, fans are&nbsp;
now primed to see a return of one of the most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:09.360 --> 00:10:14.080
beloved Jedi warriors in "Star Wars"&nbsp;
history. They might even learn how&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:19.120
Obi-Wan kept Luke's identity and presence&nbsp;
from the Empire concealed all those years.

00:10:19.120 --> 00:10:24.000
"Obi-Wan Kenobi" will also see another famous&nbsp;
"Star Wars" actor reprise a former role.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:27.040
Hayden Christensen will return as Darth Vader.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:27.040 --> 00:10:31.840
How much of Christensen's face we&nbsp;
will actually see is unknown, however.

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:34.720
“This is the end for you, my master.”

00:10:35.600 --> 00:10:39.680
"Obi-Wan Kenobi" is set ten years after the&nbsp;
third installment of the prequel series,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:44.400
"Revenge of the Sith," which portrayed Anakin's&nbsp;
transformation into Darth Vader once and for all.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:44.400 --> 00:10:50.000
So it stands to reason that much of Christensen's&nbsp;
performance could be hidden behind his character's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:56.800
iconic helmet. Regardless, "Obi-Wan Kenobi" is&nbsp;
sure to please anxious "Star Wars" fans in 2022.

